WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.590
Plan the year's budget, record the real costs, and settle the difference with each tenant at year-end.

2
00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:13.970
Service charge shares the cost of running the mall among the tenants.

3
00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:19.780
The budget, the costs so far, what was billed and the expected balance.

4
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:25.490
The budget sets the cost of each category for the year.

5
00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.350
Choose next year.

6
00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.070
Start from last year with an uplift, then adjust any line.

7
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:36.310
Choose Start from last year.

8
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:40.760
Through the year, record the real costs under Actual costs.

9
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:45.400
Choose the month and the category, and the amount.

10
00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:55.350
Choose Add cost. You can also import them, or bring them from the accounts.

11
00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:01.500
At year-end, Reconciliation compares what each tenant paid with their real share.

12
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:07.710
Each tenant gets a statement to print: a refund, or a balance to pay.
